# OpenSMTPD table(5) format: <label> <username>:<password>
# The label must match modules/smtp-relay.nix's relay URL
# (smtp+tls://relay@... auth <secrets>) — "relay" here, not your real
# username. Fill in the real upstream SMTP username/password matching
# mySystem.smtp in variables.nix.
relay CHANGE-ME-USERNAME:CHANGE-ME-PASSWORD
